 * This component provides code folding functionality for the Minotaur editor.
 * It allows users to collapse and expand code blocks.
 *
 * Usage:
 * <CodeFolding Code="your code here" LanguageId="csharp" />
 *
 * Features:
 * - Automatic detection of foldable regions
 * - Manual folding with #region directives
 * - Collapse/expand all functionality
 * - Persistent fold state
 * - Keyboard shortcuts
 * - Visual indicators for folded code
 *
 * Dependencies:
 * - Minotaur.Core.Services.Editor.CodeFoldingService
 * - Minotaur.Core.Models.Editor.CodeFoldingModels
